  "description": "One day, as Kim Soo-hyun grew increasingly weary of a world he could never change no matter how hard he tried, a mysterious man named Oh Jong-doo appeared before him. With effortless skill, Oh Jong-doo pulled various weapons from his coat, subdued a giant monster, and then calmly disappeared, pulling his cart behind him. Witnessing this, Kim Soo-hyun felt an indescribable thrill.\n\nAn action-packed adventure featuring the righteous prosecutor Kim Soo-hyun and the unreliable hero Oh Jong-doo!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/49170525), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5025342), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746012613), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/jaedam_sr_0119), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/5426), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H039200945), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H039200945), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=wqqr), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=7mc9) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/68325)",
